---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const diaryJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Day 174 Reflections",
  "datePublished": "2026-10-20",
  "dateModified": "2026-10-20",
  "description": "Day 174. Reflections on today's work and lessons learned.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Mr. Wu",
    "alternateName": "Guanwu"
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-10-20 | Day 174 Reflections" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 174. Reflections on today's work and lessons learned." navActive="diary" lang="en">
  <article class="diary-entry">
    <header class="diary-header">
      <time datetime="2026-10-20">2026-10-20</time>
      <span class="diary-day">Day 174 Reflections</span>
    </header>

    <div class="diary-content">
      <p class="day-number">Day 174</p>

      <div class="english-summary">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <p>Day 174. Reflections on today's work and lessons learned.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="full-english-content">
        <h3>Full English Content</h3>
        <p>Day 174 </p>
      <h2>What I Did Today</h2>
      <p>[Content about: 迁移完成后，开始搭建自动化系统。创建了自动日记和AI新闻的定...]</p>
      <h2>[Content about: 自动化的意义...]</h2>
      <p>[Content about: 自动化不是目的，而是手段。...]</p>
      <p>[Content about: 很多人会问：为什么要自动化？是为了偷懒吗？...]</p>
      <p>[Content about: 不完全是。自动化的真正意义在于：...]</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>释放注意力</strong> - 把重复性工作交给机器，把精力放在创造性工作上</li>
        <li><strong>保持一致性</strong> - 人会偷懒，但机器不会。每天准时更新，形成习惯和节奏</li>
        <li><strong>降低心理负担</strong> - 知道系统在自动运行，就不会焦虑"今天还没更新"</li>
      </ol>
      <h2>[Content about: 但自动化也有陷阱...]</h2>
      <p>[Content about: 自动化最容易让人陷入"虚假的勤奋"。...]</p>
      <p>[Content about: 系统每天自动生成日记和AI新闻，看起来很忙。但如果生成的内容...]</p>
      <p>[Content about: 所以自动化的前提是：...]</p>
      <ul>
        <li>有清晰的质量标准</li>
        <li>有验证机制</li>
        <li>有人工审查环节</li>
      </ul>
      <p>[Content about: 我设置的自动化系统会每天生成基础内容，但我会在每周回顾时检查...]</p>
      <h2>[Content about: 技术实现...]</h2>
      <p>[Content about: 今天的自动化系统包括：...]</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>auto-diary.py</strong> - 分析当天git提交，生成日记草稿</li>
        <li><strong>auto-news.py</strong> - 从RSS源采集AI新闻，生成新闻汇总</li>
        <li><strong>Windows定时任务</strong> - 每天22:00自动运行脚本</li>
        <li><strong>GitHub Actions</strong> - 自动构建和部署网站</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Working on: 整个链路是：定时任务触发脚本 → 生成内容 → git提交 → GitHub Actions构建 → 部署到Cloudflare Pages...</p>
      <h2>[Content about: 一个反思...]</h2>
      <p>[Content about: 自动化是放大器，不是替代品。...]</p>
      <p>Working on: 如果你的工作流本身有问题，自动化只会让问题更快地重复...</p>
      <p>[Content about: 所以，在自动化之前，先确保你的工作流是正确的，你的标准是清晰...]</p>
      <p>Working on: 今天的自动化系统，建立在之前几个月的手动实践基础上...</p>
      <p>Day 174.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-notice">
        <p>📝 This is an English translation of the diary entry. The original Chinese version is also <a href="/diary/2026-10-20/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">available</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="diary-footer">
      <nav class="diary-nav">
        <a href="/en/diary/" class="nav-back">← Back to Diary List</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .diary-entry {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header time {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .diary-day {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .day-number {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .diary-content {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .english-summary {
    background: var(--color-bg, #f9fafb);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .full-english-content {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .full-english-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h2) {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h3) {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(p) {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .full-english-content :global(ul),
  .full-english-content :global(ol) {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }
  .full-english-content :global(li) {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }
  .full-english-content :global(strong) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .content-notice {
    background: #e0f2fe;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .content-notice p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #075985;
  }
  .diary-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
  }
  .nav-back {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-back:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
  }
</style>
